DynGUA-PD manages downstream IPv6 prefix delegation pools through native
pfSense configuration and Kea DHCPv6.

It discovers Track6 upstream prefixes, avoids occupied networks, and maintains
explicit ownership of delegated pools. Native pfSense routines apply settings
and maintain lease routes. Conflicts and missing prerequisites block changes.

The package includes a native GUI, an asynchronous verification worker, and an
optional read-only adapter for the DHCPv6 page.
